  "description": "VOWDAP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H73 Dy6 N18 O31,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.857-4.152 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.56-119.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C73H76Dy6N18O32. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
